   "text": "NVIDIA sells to every cloud and on-prem buyer. Trainium only exists inside AWS (EC2, Bedrock).\nTPUs only exist inside Google Cloud. All three run Claude: Trainium2 (Project Rainier), TPUs (up to 1M), NVIDIA GPUs.",
